cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASF in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Sandboxing Framework (ASF)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Moreno"
    given-names: "Javier"
version: 2.0
date-released: 2026-08-26
abstract: >-
  A fail-closed framework for running AI coding agents in isolated rootless
  Podman containers, combining no-gateway network topology, generated and
  per-session-verified egress policy, credential brokering, and dependency-
  ordered resource teardown with persisted session evidence records.
keywords:
  - sandboxing
  - AI agents
  - container security
  - network isolation
license: BSD-4-Clause
